            <title>[IGNITE-4614] .NET: Binary schema is not reset in BinaryReader</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4614</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;BinaryReader&lt;/tt&gt; does not reset &lt;tt&gt;_frame.Schema&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;_frame.SchemaMap&lt;/tt&gt;. This can cause bugs with certain object nesting layouts. &lt;/p&gt;

